'''Crazy Cats (Insane)''' is the ninth [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stage]]. It appears on the '''27th''' and the '''28th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it appears every '''Friday'''.

